Kusto Query Language (KQL)

Azure uses KQL to query logs.

Example:

AzureActivity

| limit 10

Show recent activity.

Another example:

Heartbeat

| summarize count()

Count VM heartbeat records.

For AKS:

ContainerLog

| limit 20

View recent container logs.

